  "question": {
    "text": "Let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>&#945;</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mi>&#946;</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>R</mi></math>. Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math> be the value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi></math> which satisfies <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math> be the value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi></math> which satisfies <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>B</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math>. Then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced></math> is equal to",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "2",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>&#945;</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mi>&#946;</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>R</mi></math>,</p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>&#945;</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p>Now&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>&#945;</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>&#945;</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>3</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>&#945;</mi></mtd><mtd><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p>Also,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>&#945;</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>&#945;</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>&#945;</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#945;</mi></mtd><mtd><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p>Now solving&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>3</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mtd><mtd><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mtd><mtd><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p>Now on comparing both side we get,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math></p><p>And&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>B</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mi>&#946;</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mi>&#946;</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><msup><mi>&#946;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>&#946;</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>&#946;</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p>Now using&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>B</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><msup><mi>&#946;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>&#946;</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>&#946;</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>3</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>&#945;</mi></mtd><mtd><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p>Again on comparing both side we get,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p></blockquote>",
